.TH CSTR_APPEND 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cstr_append \- append a C string, and call ccol_fatal_err() on failure
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cstring.h>

cstr_append(s, str);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
This macro calls cstring_append() and then calls ccol_fatal_err() if the
return value is not ccol_success.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
s     cstr to change
str   C string to append (must not be NULL)
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Call cstring_append() directly when you want to handle an error yourself
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cstring_append (3),
.BR cstr_prepend (3),
.BR cstr_insert (3),
.BR cstr_set (3)
